The example data of the Sapling SAS macro library

The SAS transport files (version 5) of this folder are data sets of two R packages of pharmaverse, written by
make_data.R with haven::write_xpt:

- pharmaverseadam 1.3.0, https://github.com/pharmaverse/pharmaverseadam, Apache License 2.0:
  adsl.xpt (adsl), adae.xpt (adae), advs.xpt (advs), adlb.xpt (adlb), adtte.xpt (adtte_onco), adrs.xpt (adrs_onco);
- pharmaversesdtm 1.4.0, https://github.com/pharmaverse/pharmaversesdtm, Apache License 2.0:
  ds.xpt (ds), ex.xpt (ex).

The subjects are those of the CDISC pilot study (public example data). The files are subsets, no values changed:
some records and variables are left out (the size of the files), and a few variables are added, each derived from
the data of the packages: the treatment numbers TRT01PN and TRT01AN (the planned doses 0, 54 and 81 mg), the
treatments of ADSL on adtte, and TEAECNT on adsl (the number of treatment-emergent adverse events of a subject).
make_data.R writes each subset and each added variable.

